      "body": {
        "en": "*W* is in: inside a building, a town or a country: *w kinie*, *w banku*, *w Krakowie*, *w Polsce*. *Na* is on, and also at an event or an open place: *na filmie*, *na koncercie*, *na ulicy*, *na stole*. Some places simply take *na*, so learn them together: *na poczcie*, *na policji*, *na dworcu*, *na lotnisku*, *na basenie*, *na uniwersytecie*. At work is *w pracy*."
